    "title": "<p>Differential diagnosis of primary cutaneous follicle centre lymphoma with a diffuse growth pattern (PCFCL-diffuse) rich in large and/or spindle cells and primary cutaneous diffuse large B-cell lymphoma, leg type (PCLBCL-LT)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Oschlies I., Willemze R., Vergier B.",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 703.3pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"938\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Feature</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>PCFCL-diffuse, large/spindle cell&ndash;rich</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>PCLBCL-LT</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Histopathology</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 547.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"730\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Morphology of tumour cells </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Predominance of large centrocytes including multilobated and spindle cells; centroblasts may be present, but not in confluent sheets</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Predominance or confluent sheets of round centroblasts and/or immunoblasts, rarer round blastoid cells</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>High proliferation</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++ in PCFCL-diffuse</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Diffuse growth</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Follicular growth</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+/&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus; (nodules possible)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Reactive T&nbsp;cells</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Immunophenotype</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 547.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"730\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>IRF4&nbsp;(MUM1)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>BCL2</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>IgM</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">++<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CD10</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>BCL6</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+/&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Cell of origin algorithm</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">GCB</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Non-GCB<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 134.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CD21+ FDC networks</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+/&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 15; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Molecular alterations (in&nbsp;diagnostic setting)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em>MYD88</em> mutation is absent</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em>BCL2</em> breaks ~10%</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">No <em>MYC</em> breaks</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em>MYD88</em> and/or <em>CD79B</em> mutation ~70%</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em>MYC</em> breaks ~30%</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">No <em>BCL2</em> breaks</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 16; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Clinical presentation</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Scalp, upper body</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Exceptional at leg</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Rare systemic progression</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Leg, lower body; less commonly, arms</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Exceptional at head/neck</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Most cases with systemic progression</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 17; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.95pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Treatment and outcome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Local treatment, 95% DSS</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 278.05pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"371\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Systemic treatment, ~50% DSS</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DSS, disease-specific survival; FDC, follicular dendritic cell; GCB, germinal-centre B&nbsp;cell.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>Rare deviation from the typical immunophenotype (e.g. weak CD10 expression, absence of BCL2 or IgM&nbsp;/ IRF4&nbsp;[MUM1]) is acceptable, if the other criteria fit with PCLBCL-LT.</p>",
